# Wild & Wired OS: Ridge & Hollow (direction 1A) colour scheme.
# Source: frontend-design handoff token table. Structure teal (#12837b)
# never sits on a text role. No red, amber or blue: negative and neutral
# states are white ink, stated in copy as well as colour. Secondary ink
# is #9dbebd (not #8fb3b2) wherever it can land on #0a4f58, to hold 4.5:1.

